&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135935/poll-which-is-your-favourite-modular-building'&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: FXX</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135928</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135928</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/30195-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: FXX"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/30195-1'&gt;30195&lt;/a&gt; FXX, released during 2012. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Racers/year-2012'&gt;11 Racers sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/30195-1'&gt;53 pieces&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 4,741 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=30195-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=30195-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $11.90,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=30195-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135928/random-set-of-the-day-fxx"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>